{
  "Pregnancy.CorruptedWitch.BellyFull": "<b>Your belly is as big as it will get. You cradle it every once in a while, eager to bring your child to the world.[pg]</b>"
  "Pregnancy.CorruptedWitch.BellyGrown": "<b>Your distended belly has grown noticeably. You're sweating profusely. Whatever is growing inside of you, it's unusually warm.</b>[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.CorruptedWitch.BellySlightlyLarger": "<b>You realize your belly has gotten slightly larger. Maybe you need to cut back on the strange food.</b>[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.CorruptedWitch.DropsOfMilk": "Drops of breastmilk escape your nipples as your body prepares for the coming birth.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.CorruptedWitch.FullAndLactating": "<b>You realize your breasts feel full, and occasionally lactate</b>. It must be due to the pregnancy.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.CorruptedWitch.GrewToBCups": "<b>Your breasts have grown to B-cups,</b> likely due to the hormonal changes of your pregnancy.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.CorruptedWitch.GrewToCCups": "<b>Your breasts have swollen to C-cups,</b> in light of your coming pregnancy.[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.CorruptedWitch.HipsWider": "[pg]After the birth, your {0} fits a bit more snugly about your {1}."
  "Pregnancy.CorruptedWitch.SwollenWithMilk": "Your breasts feel swollen with all the extra milk they're accumulating. You hope it'll be enough for the coming birth.[pg]"
}
